<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:lang="lzh"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>法國顛人</title><title type="alternate">Fa guo dian ren [A French Man Taken to an Asylum]</title><author>無署名（《東華新報》）</author><respStmt><resp>整理與編碼</resp><name>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu)</name></respStmt></titleStmt><editionStmt><edition>Transcription dataset v0.2.0</edition></editionStmt><publicationStmt><p>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu). Dataset edition 0.2.0.</p></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>東華新報</title><date when="1901-04-17">1901-04-17</date><idno>Tung Wah News, 1901-04-17, p. 2, NLA news-page24100008</idno><ref target="https://trove.nla.gov.au/newspaper/page/24100008">澳洲國家圖書館 Trove</ref></bibl></sourceDesc></fileDesc></teiHeader><facsimile><surface n="2" xml:id="original-page"><graphic url="https://trove.nla.gov.au/ndp/imageservice/nla.news-page24100008/level5" /></surface></facsimile><text><body><div type="article"><pb n="2" facs="#original-page" /><p><lb n="single-1" />○法國顛人　法商某從北京回國一日往梨園觀劇猝然發狂將塲中什物<lb n="single-2" />翻倒踐碎聲言與拳匪對敵場中執事諸多籌策乃能驅入一小房內隨卽<lb n="single-3" />覓得巡差擬欲昇往顛房於時該商將房門緊閉不許人進自稱乃是保護<lb n="single-4" />使館之人差答以我是聯軍商始准入內問差將欲何爲差云吾將偕爾入<lb n="single-5" />見法總統該商云吾正欲晉謁我國總統蓋駐京之法總教牧謀娶太后爲<lb n="single-6" />妻吾將入奏參劾之遂欣然同往及至顛房乃拘該商入內</p></div></body></text></TEI>